# 换行符策略（强制 LF）
#
# 为什么必须写死：Shell 脚本一旦被 Windows 的 autocrlf 转成 CRLF，
# 在 Linux 云主机上会以 "bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M" 直接失败——
# 而本地一切正常，属于最典型的「环境相关故障」。
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
*.jar binary
